navigating from other tree elements](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116518)\r\n\r\nTo my knowledge, this simple check draws the GridMap after everything is rendered, and appears.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n[2026-02-19, 21:58 UTC-5]\r\nCalling _draw_grid() and update_grid() earlier fixes the problem, so another process is most likely called earlier than previously was in v4.5.1-stable. Still investigating the issue.\r\n\r\n[2026-02-21, 00:03 UTC-5]\r\nIn ```void EditorNode::edit_item(Object *p_object, Object *p_editing_owner)```, the ```GridMapEditorPlugin``` enters ```to_over_edit.push_back(plugin);```. As a result, gets sent to ```_plugin_over_edit```, where:\r\n```\r\np_plugin->edit(p_object);\r\np_plugin->make_visible(true);\r\n```\r\nWhen switching between GridMaps, the plugin is already activated, and enters another if clause, where:\r\n```\r\np_plugin->make_visible(true);\r\np_plugin->edit(p_object);\r\n```\r\nThe second option works.\r\n\r\n[2026-02-24, 17:28 UTC-5]\r\nExpected process in EditorNode, temporary fix works, undraft\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"re